  "description": "An XrmToolBox tool that finds where a Dataverse table or column is referenced by business rules, JavaScript web resources, forms and form event registrations, plugin registrations, classic workflows and cloud flows, and exports an evidence-based impact report to Excel. Read-only analysis; every finding is labelled with how strong its evidence is. Maintainer: Gagan Deep Singh (https://www.linkedin.com/in/glowofsky/). Host: XrmToolBox. Data platform: Microsoft Dataverse. Export format: Excel workbook (.xlsx).",
